# Exhaustiveness checking for nominal variants with named-payload constructors.
# Verifies that a non-exhaustive match on a locally-defined nominal type
# correctly raises a typecheck error listing the missing constructor.
[
  Shape: [type [Circle radius: Int] [Square side: Int]]

  circle-only: [fn [let s@Shape]
    [match s
      [case [let p] [Circle p] p.radius]
    ]
  ]

  result: 42
]
=== out
inferred type is Unknown
